An empty comment span is written as adjacent delimiters

```
- a
  :: u
  : %%%
  %%%
- c
.
<ul>
  <li>a
    <dl>
      <dt>u</dt>
      <dd></dd>
    </dl>
  </li>
  <li>c</li>
</ul>
```

```
- %%%
  %%%
- c
.
<ul>
  <li></li>
  <li>c</li>
</ul>
```

```
- a
  %%%
  %%%
- c
.
<ul>
  <li>a</li>
  <li>c</li>
</ul>
```
